<view class="page" data-b="B224"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B224" /><view class="title">时间块统计</view><view class="subtitle">按一次选块并点标签算一条记录；多格连续时间只计一次。</view><view class="period-switch" data-b="B226"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B226" /><text class="{{period === 'day' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-period="day" data-z="Z226-1" bindtap="choosePeriod">本日</text><text class="{{period === 'week' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-period="week" data-z="Z226-2" bindtap="choosePeriod">本周</text><text class="{{period === 'month' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-period="month" data-z="Z226-3" bindtap="choosePeriod">本月</text></view><view class="card summary" data-b="B227"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B227" /><view><text class="big">{{count}}</text><text>条记录</text></view><view><text class="big">{{duration}}</text><text>记录时长</text></view></view><view class="card" data-b="B228"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B228" /><view class="section-title">标签明细</view><view class="table-head"><text>标签</text><text>次数</text><text>时长</text></view><view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}" class="empty">这段时间还没有时间块记录。</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="key" class="table-row"><view><text>{{item.primary}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.secondary}}" class="secondary">└ {{item.secondary}}</text></view><text>{{item.count}}</text><text>{{item.duration}}</text></view></view><view class="subtitle foot">这里统计已记录的安排，不代表服务收入或实际完成课时。</view></view>
